["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">無くなる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なくなる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">丢失；遗失；不见了；用完；耗尽；消耗殆尽；没有了；消失；隐没；消退</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233128\">あなたの<ruby>青<rp>(</rp><rt>あお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いペンがなくなってしまいました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I misplaced your blue pen.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">慰める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なぐさめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">安慰；抚慰；逗乐</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79719\"><ruby>夜<rp>(</rp><rt>よる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>静<rp>(</rp><rt>しず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けさが<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちを<ruby>慰<rp>(</rp><rt>なぐさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めてくれる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The silence of the night comforts us.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なぐる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">殴打；击打；打击；拳打</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215639\">ジョージは<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>腹<rp>(</rp><rt>はら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>殴<rp>(</rp><rt>なぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">George hit him in the stomach.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">嘆く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なげく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">叹息；悲伤；遗憾；痛惜；愤慨</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"236325\">「<ruby>財布<rp>(</rp><rt>さいふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>無<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くした」ジョンは<ruby>嘆<rp>(</rp><rt>なげ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">&quot;I lost my wallet,&quot; lamented John.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">投げ出す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なげだす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">抛出；扔出；伸出（腿）；抛弃；辞职；放弃；慷慨给予；无私奉献；舍生忘死；开始投掷</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189440\"><ruby>運転手<rp>(</rp><rt>うんてんしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>運転台<rp>(</rp><rt>うんてんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からもんどり<ruby>打<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>投<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げ<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The driver was thrown from his seat head over heels.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">投げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">投掷；抛；扔；甩；放弃；抛弃；丢弃；投射；投出（目光、影子、怀疑等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210222\">その<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>犬<rp>(</rp><rt>いぬ</