 class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78197\"><ruby>旅<rp>(</rp><rt>たび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>道連<rp>(</rp><rt>みちづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れ<ruby>世<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>情<rp>(</rp><rt>なさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">No road is long with good company.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">情け深い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なさけぶかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">心地善良；富有同情心；慈悲心强</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なさる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">做；干；进行</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214623\">ステーキの<ruby>焼<rp>(</rp><rt>や</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどうなさいますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">How would you like your steak?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">無し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">无；没有；不可接受；不行；不令人满意；不存在；没有</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192872\">ようやくその<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>貸<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>借<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>無<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I am finally quits with the man.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">詰る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なじる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">责骂；斥责；指责；挑剔；批评；执意追问；反复质问（以批评或挑错为目的）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143468\"><ruby>世<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をなじる<ruby>者<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>世<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からなじられる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He who rebukes the world is rebuked by the world.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">為す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">做；实行；进行；造成</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199301\">なした<ruby>約束<rp>(</rp><rt>やくそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>払<rp>(</rp><rt>はら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってない<ruby>借<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りである。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">A promise made is a debt unpaid.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なぜ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">为什么；怎么会；何以；什么原因</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"232436\">あなたはなぜ<ruby>働<rp>(</rp><rt>はたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いているの。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">How come you&#x27;re still working?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なぜなら</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">因为；理由是；如果你想知道为什么</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199225\">なぜなら<ruby>新聞記者<rp>(</rp><rt>しんぶんきしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だったからです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Because I was a newspaper reporter.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">謎</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なぞ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">谜语；谜题；谜团；神秘事物；神秘的；谜一样的；莫测的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"120756\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がなぜ<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をやめたのかは<ruby>謎<rp>(</rp><rt>なぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It is a mystery why he quit his job.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">謎謎</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なぞなぞ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">谜语；谜题；谜团</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113158\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそのなぞなぞを<ruby>難<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なく<ruby>解<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He had no difficulty explaining the mystery.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">名高い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なだかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">著名的；闻名的；知名的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211401\">その<ruby>教授<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうじゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はシェークスピアの<ruby>研究<rp>(</rp><rt>けんきゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>名高<rp>(</rp><rt>なだか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The professor is noted for his study of Shakespeare.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">雪崩</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なだれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">雪崩；雪滑；雪崩；雪崩定石</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141957\"><ruby>雪崩<rp>(</rp><rt>なだれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>道路<rp>(</rp><rt>どうろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がふさがった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The road was blocked by an avalanche.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">納得</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なっとく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同意；赞成；接受；理解；信服；满意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"236543\">「そっか」ウィリーはようやく<ruby>納得<rp>(</rp><rt>なっとく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">&quot;Well, OK,&quot; Willie finally agreed.</span></div></li>","<li cl