d\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夏休み</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なつやすみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">暑假；暑期</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184362\"><ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>より<ruby>夏休<rp>(</rp><rt>なつやす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みのほうがいいです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I like summer holidays better than school.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">名付ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なづける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">命名；称呼；给…起名；命名为</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"89703\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>子猫<rp>(</rp><rt>こねこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をジャガーと<ruby>名付<rp>(</rp><rt>なづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She called the kitten &quot;Jaguar&quot;.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">撫でる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なでる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">抚摸；爱抚；轻轻刷过；拍；揉；梳理；抚平</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75710\"><ruby>母<rp>(</rp><rt>はは</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はため<ruby>息<rp>(</rp><rt>いき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をつきながら、<ruby>高校<rp>(</rp><rt>こうこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>一年生<rp>(</rp><rt>いちねんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にもなった<ruby>息子<rp>(</rp><rt>むすこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>頭<rp>(</rp><rt>あたま</rt><rp>)</rp