skew.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">什么；那个东西；你懂的；那玩意儿；那什么东西；那谁；阴茎；那话儿；（一点也）不；（毫）不；什么？；嗯？；喂！；搞什么！；什么嘛（表示恼怒）；没事；没关系；哪里</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172752\"><ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のアナウンスは<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だったのですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">What did the announcement just say?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何か</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なにか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">某事；某物；什么东西；不知为何；莫名其妙；你想说什么？；你是什么意思？</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何気ない</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なにげない</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">漫不经心的；若无其事的；不在意的；随意的；平凡的；普通的；寻常的；日常的；平平常常的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"92299\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>何気<rp>(</rp><rt>なにげ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なく<ruby>目<rp>(</rp><rt>め</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をやった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She took a casual glance at the book.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なにしろ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">总之；无论如何；反正；毕竟；说起来；因为；由于；既然；毕竟</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"93161\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はうまくゆかなかったが、なにしろ<ruby>初<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めてのことだったからね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She did not succeed, but after all that was her first attempt.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何卒</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なにとぞ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">请；恳请；拜托了；烦请；务必；一定；无论如何</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何々</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なになに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">什么；某某；如此这般；什么的；什么？；等等；慢着；好吧；让我看看；不；哦（一点也不）；请；好了好了</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何分</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なにぶん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">某些；某种；有些；一点；请；敬请；无论如何；总之；毕竟；反正</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なにも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">（没有）任何东西；什么都不；（一点）都没有；以及其他一切；等等；（一点）都不；丝毫不；不怎么；不至于那样</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186512\"><ruby>過<rp>(</rp><rt>あやま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちのない<ruby>者<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He who makes no mistakes makes nothing.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何より</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なにより</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">最重要的是；首先；比什么都重要；最好的；极好的；了不起的；最重要的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"156308\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>自分<rp>(</rp><rt>じぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>健康<rp>(</rp><rt>けんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よりだと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I count myself lucky in having good health.</span></div></li>"]